## Capability Layers

### Customer Services

Responsible for customer engagement and sales.

- Customer Management
- Booking Management
- Pricing & Quotations

---

### Products & Operations

Responsible for delivering tourism products and services.

- Tour Management
- Accommodation Management
- Supplier Management
- Availability Management
- Itinerary Management

---

### Business Support

Provides financial, operational and platform support services.

- Payment Management
- Invoicing & Refunds
- Document Management
- Notifications
- Security & Identity

---

## Notes

- Layers represent logical business groupings.
- Solid arrows indicate primary business dependencies.
- Dashed arrows indicate supporting capabilities.
- The diagram is conceptual and does not represent business processes or system architecture.